# What you put INTO the app, as opposed to what the app is. Notes are your
# writing and media is your photographs; both are private and neither belongs
# in version control, even in a private repo. Photos have a second reason: a
# year of daily images is a repo nobody wants to clone.
#
# The consequence is that the repo is NOT a complete backup. These files have
# one copy unless something else copies them — see SYNC.md.
data/media/
data/notes/
